  "label": "Donor Card Concept",
  "description": "A donor card is a legal document that indicates a person's willingness to donate their organs or tissues after death. The meme humorously misuses this concept by implying that Stephen Hawking, a person with a physical disability, might have been a source of spare parts for a go-cart, which is an absurd and disrespectful implication.",
